What is Food Packaging Analysis?

Food Packaging Analysis comprises specialized testing services vital for verifying the safety, integrity, and sustainability of materials used in food containment. These analyses enable detection of chemical migrants, evaluation of physical durability, and assessment of barrier effectiveness, spanning techniques like migration studies, tensile testing, gas permeability measurements, and spectroscopic identification. Core categories encompass Chemistry Analysis, Physics Analysis, and others.

